<title>POLAND: JUTRZENKA OCT NET RISES TO PLN 1.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>JUTRZENKA OCT NET RISES TO PLN 1.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.53 vs   1.26</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.89 vs   1.85</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.07 vs   2.00</p>
<p> Sales		   15.13 vs   9.21</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     8.82 vs   7.55</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	14.56 vs  10.32</p>
<p> Operating profit    15.90 vs  10.47</p>
<p> Sales		  103.71 vs  67.48</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish confectioner is Jutrzenka SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
